          "items": [
            "Inlet Oasis is a family friendly home in Inlet Beach near 30A. Only a 4-minute drive to Rosemary Beach & 3-minute drive to the white, sugar sand & emerald beach. A one minute walk to the pool. We include it all!!! 4 bikes, beach chairs, umbrella, stand up paddle board, life jackets, beach toys, beach towels, beach wagon and bike trailer, 2 highchairs, a Pack -N-Play and a well-stocked kitchen. Avenue 30A is 1 minute away with many restaurants within a 5 minute walk. Come Relax & unwind!!!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
